(9)
to appoint persons working in any other University or organisation as teachers of the University for a specified period;
(10)
to create administrative, ministerial and other posts, and to make appointments thereto;
(11)
to co-operate or collaborate with any other University or authority in such manner and for such purposes as the
University may determine;
(12)
to establish such campuses, centres, specialised laboratories or other units for research and instruction as are, in the
